        <p>An electrical problem at home can cause inconvenience or even risk. Whether it is a faulty outlet, unstable lighting, or the need for a new installation, we respond quickly and work precisely. We provide electrical services in Varna and nearby areas with on-site diagnostics, repair, and installation, without unnecessary waiting.</p>
        <h2>What residential electrical services we provide in Varna</h2>
        <p>Clients often contact us for no power in specific rooms, sparks at outlets, or unstable appliance operation. We perform electrical appliance and wiring repairs, as well as full replacement of electrical installations in homes and houses. We handle both small corrections and full new installation projects.</p>
        <p>Outlet and switch installation is one of the most frequent requests. We install new points, including double outlets, outdoor outlets, and additional outlet boxes where expansion is needed. If a light switch is faulty or lighting flickers, we replace switches and inspect connections.</p>
        <p>Lighting is also a key part of every home. We install lighting fixtures, including chandeliers and track lighting for modern interiors. When needed, we can also help with LED lighting upgrades for better efficiency and function.</p>
        <p>Besides electrical services, we also provide repairs for other home appliances. If you have a boiler issue, you can check our boiler repair and installation service, oven repair options, and the full list of Varna services on one page.</p>
        <h2>Which appliance and equipment brands we service in Varna</h2>
        <p>We work with all popular brands and established manufacturers of home appliances and electrical equipment. Whether it is appliance repair or connection to a new installation, we adapt to the specifics of each brand and model to ensure safe and long-term operation.</p>
        <h2>Areas in Varna we cover</h2>
